        <h2 id="sec-5">5. Field Tags &amp; Explicit 4-Bit Wire Types</h2>
        <p>
          Every field in the message begins with a <strong>Tag</strong> encoded as a Prefix-Varint:
        </p>
        <pre><code>Tag = (FieldNumber &lt;&lt; 4) | WireType</code></pre>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <code>FieldNumber</code> is the non-negative schema field number (<code>0</code> for the
            inline schema table, <code>1..N</code> for data fields).
          </li>
          <li>
            <code>WireType</code> is a 4-bit unsigned integer (<code>0..15</code>).
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3 id="sec-5-1">
          5.1 Tag Width for Field Numbers <code>0..7</code> vs <code>8..1023</code>
        </h3>
        <p>
          <strong>
            Fields <code>#0</code> through <code>#7</code>
          </strong>{' '}
          have <code>Tag = (FieldNumber &lt;&lt; 4) | WireType &lt;= 127</code>. They ALWAYS encode
          as a <strong>1-byte tag</strong>:
        </p>
        <pre><code>1-Byte Tag Layout (Fields #0..#7):
  Bit 7   Bit 6   Bit 5   Bit 4   Bit 3   Bit 2   Bit 1   Bit 0
+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+
|   FieldNumber (3 bits: 0..7)  |     WireType (4 bits) |   1   |
+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+
Byte 0 = uint8(FieldNumber &lt;&lt; 5) | uint8(WireType &lt;&lt; 1) | 0x01</code></pre>

        <p>
          <strong>
            Fields <code>#8</code> through <code>#1023</code>
          </strong>{' '}
          have <code>128 &lt;= Tag &lt;= 16383</code>. They ALWAYS encode as a{' '}
          <strong>2-byte little-endian tag</strong>:
        </p>
        <pre><code>2-Byte Tag Layout (Fields #8..#1023):
  Byte 0 (LSB)                                    Byte 1 (MSB)
+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+ +-------------------------------+
| fn[1] | fn[0] |     WireType (4 bits) | 1 | 0 | |     FieldNumber[9..2]         |
+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+-------+ +-------------------------------+
LE16(Byte 0..1) = uint16(FieldNumber &lt;&lt; 6) | uint16(WireType &lt;&lt; 2) | 0x02</code></pre>

